  "rashi": "לְצֹרֶךְ בתים לבדים, כְּתַרְגּוּמוֹ – אַתְרָא לַאֲרִיחַיָּא:",
  "tr": "לבתים means for the purpose of being (to serve as) receptacles for the staves, as the Targum has it: places for the staves.",
