  "rashi": "כְּתַרְגּוּמוֹ, \"לְרָמַת דַּחַלְתֵּהּ\", שֵׁם עֲ\"זָ:",
  "tr": "במות בעל BAMOTH-BAAL — Understand this as the Targum does: to the heights of his god (more lit., of that which he reverenced); Baal is the name of a god.",
